<title>USA: Harvey's Casino to sell Hard Rock stake.</title>
<headline>Harvey's Casino to sell Hard Rock stake.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harvey's Casino Resorts said Wednesday it has agreed to sell its stake in Hard Rock Hotel and Casino to Hard Rock Hotel Inc for $45 million in cash.</p>
<p>Harvey's said it will continue to manage the hotel property until the deal closes and it anticipates no personnel changes.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to approval by Nevada gaming authorities, among a number of conditions, it said.</p>
